==Old English==

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*mēgaz||kin}}. Cognate with {{etyl|dum|-}} {{term|maech|lang=dum}} ({{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|maag|lang=nl}}), {{etyl|goh|-}} {{term|māg|lang=goh}}, {{etyl|got|-}} {{term|𐌼𐌴𐌲𐍃||tr=mēgs|son-in-law|lang=got}}, {{etyl|sv|-}} {{term|måg||make|lang=sv}}.

====Pronunciation====
